  "articles": [
    {
      "sequence_id": 1,
      "text": "To the Student:\n\nContinue pointing at countries while asking your instructor “यह क्या है ?” and say the names of all the countries. Each student should take turns asking each other this question until all have been named. If you don't have an answer, say “मालूम नहीं” or “याद नहीं” and ask someone else.\n\n\nनमस्ते is an all-purpose greeting. It may be used to mean Hello, Goodbye, Good Morning, or Good Night.\n"
    }
